    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676010/extras/366b205864cbec3ead398a9421c9a1bd.poster.avif?t=1740387174\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676010/extras/366b205864cbec3ead398a9421c9a1bd.webm?t=1740387174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676010/extras/366b205864cbec3ead398a9421c9a1bd.mp4?t=1740387174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a young masseur who has been trained since childhood, inheriting exceptional skills passed down through generations. For personal reasons, you decided to leave home and open a small massage studio in an apartment near a university. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, by chance, you meet a girl who is a member of the university's basketball club. She is the second strongest player on the team, with her sights set on winning the national championship. However, she is currently struggling with a foot injury. After hearing her story, you decide to help her. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a skilled masseur, you must design a massage therapy plan to gradually heal her injury. Using your inherited techniques and bold methods, you will enhance her physical abilities and help her achieve victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With less than two months left until the competition, an exciting and heartwarming journey of rehabilitation begins\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676010/extras/8535a59e5e417eb64a5b4c0339eab1cc.avif?t=1740387174\" width=480 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676010/extras/838121cbf37a251ca17d782ecb195291.avif?t=1740387174\" width=480 height=360 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging mini-games featuring various massage activities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing daily life simulation and character development </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intimate physical interactions with a shy and athletic heroine </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different endings for you to discover </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Live2D animated H-scenes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akituki Noa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676010/extras/366b205864cbec3ead398a9421c9a1bd.poster.avif?t=1740387174\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676010/extras/366b205864cbec3ead398a9421c9a1bd.webm?t=1740387174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676010/extras/366b205864cbec3ead398a9421c9a1bd.mp4?t=1740387174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A member of the women's basketball club, Noa is second only to the team captain in skill. She has beautiful long hair and a well-toned, healthy body. Her goal is to win the national championship. Although she shines on the court, off the field, she is a reserved and shy girl. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money to purchase massage tools and unlock more advanced techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676010/extras/66cadf8ffd27f57601782789bf8ffc56.poster.avif?t=1740387174\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676010/extras/66cadf8ffd27f57601782789bf8ffc56.webm?t=1740387174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676010/extras/66cadf8ffd27f57601782789bf8ffc56.mp4?t=1740387174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your finely honed massage skills to improve the heroine\u2019s physical abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676010/extras/5e7212b44d4a000f21c881be6460c23e.avif?t=1740387174\" width=480 height=360 /></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend intimate nights with the heroine, allowing for deeper connections.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676010/extras/9840402a5e71af31f6fef17ee3a1900d.poster.avif?t=1740387174\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676010/extras/9840402a5e71af31f6fef17ee3a1900d.webm?t=1740387174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676010/extras/9840402a5e71af31f6fef17ee3a1900d.mp4?t=1740387174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
